      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that:\n\n(a) persons who hold a special category visa or a special purpose\nvisa; or\n\n(b) persons who have held a special category visa; or\n\n(c) persons who are present in Norfolk Island or the Territory of\nCocos (Keeling) Islands;\nand who satisfy specified requirements are, or are during a\nspecified period, persons to whom this subsection applies.\nPermanent resident under the old Act",
