      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, under this Act, it is necessary to work out if a person was a\npermanent resident at a time before the commencement day, work\nthat out under the Australian Citizenship Act 1948 as in force at\nthat time.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If, under this Act, it is necessary to work out if a person was a\npermanent resident at a time before the commencement day, work\nthat out under the Australian Citizenship Act 1948 as in force at\nthat time.",
