      "skos:note": "Work out if a person was a permanent resident under the Australian Citizenship Act 1948."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-5-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(3) Permanent resident",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, under this Act, it is necessary to work out if a person was a\npermanent resident at a time before the commencement day, work\nthat out under the Australian Citizenship Act 1948 as in force at\nthat time."
    },
