    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-6a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6A National security offences",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-6a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.17",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that:\n\n(a) an offence against a specified provision of a specified\nAustralian law or a specified foreign law; or\n\n(b) an offence against an Australian law or a foreign law\ninvolving specified conduct;\nis a national security offence for the purposes of paragraph (f) of\nthe definition of national security offence in section 3.\n\n(2) A determination under subsection (1) applies in relation to:\n\n(a) applications made under this Act after the determination\ntakes effect; and\n\n(b) applications made under this Act before the determination\ntakes effect that have not been decided before the\ndetermination takes effect.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that:\n\n(a) an offence against a specified provision of a specified\nAustralian law or a specified foreign law; or\n\n(b) an offence against an Australian law or a foreign law\ninvolving specified conduct;\nis a national security offence for the purposes of paragraph (f) of\nthe definition of national security offence in section 3.\n\n(2) A determination under subsection (1) applies in relation to:\n\n(a) applications made under this Act after the determination\ntakes effect; and\n\n(b) applications made under this Act before the determination\ntakes effect that have not been decided before the\ndetermination takes effect.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-6a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-6a-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8eb863f5f7678084ec63930e1db6d1380d23d1af1b81feee775f1cebec605f07"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-6a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6A National security offences",
      "values:kind": "section",
