    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 Confinement in prison or psychiatric institution",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "Confinement in prison\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined to a prison includes a period:\n\n(a) during which the person is an escapee from the prison; or\n\n(b) during which the person is undergoing a sentence of periodic\ndetention in the prison.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined to a prison does not include a period during which the\nperson has been so confined by reason only of the person serving a\nsentence relating to a conviction that is later quashed.\nConfinement in psychiatric institution\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined in a psychiatric institution by order of a court includes a\nperiod during which the person is an escapee from the institution.",
      "skos:definition": "Confinement in prison\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined to a prison includes a period:\n\n(a) during which the person is an escapee from the prison; or\n\n(b) during which the person is undergoing a sentence of periodic\ndetention in the prison.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined to a prison does not include a period during which the\nperson has been so confined by reason only of the person serving a\nsentence relating to a conviction that is later quashed.\nConfinement in psychiatric institution\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined in a psychiatric institution by order of a court includes a\nperiod during which the person is an escapee from the institution.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-9-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-9-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-9-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bfaf107d220e3d49a4490c11dfbf76117ecc94c24d16f155396329db87ed006f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Confinement in prison or psychiatric institution",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "Confinement in prison\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined to a prison includes a period:\n\n(a) during which the person is an escapee from the prison; or\n\n(b) during which the person is undergoing a sentence of periodic\ndetention in the prison.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined to a prison does not include a period during which the\nperson has been so confined by reason only of the person serving a\nsentence relating to a conviction that is later quashed.\nConfinement in psychiatric institution\n\n(3) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined in a psychiatric institution by order of a court includes a\nperiod during which the person is an escapee from the institution."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-9-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9(1) Confinement in prison or psychiatric institution",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-9-ss-1"
