      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is\nconfined to a prison includes a period:\n\n(a) during which the person is an escapee from the prison; or\n\n(b) during which the person is undergoing a sentence of periodic\ndetention in the prison.",
