    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10B Providing photographs and other images of faces to the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-10b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "Minister or authorised persons\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to the Minister; and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to the Minister (the recipient) a\nphotograph or other image from which the Department\ncan derive (such as by cropping) a photograph or other\nimage of the person’s face; and\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 11\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides.\n\n(2) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e); and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e) (the recipient) a photograph or\nother image from which the Department can derive\n(such as by cropping) a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face; and\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides.\n\n(3) For the purposes of the citizenship law, the person is taken to\nprovide the derived image to the recipient for the purposes of the\nrequirement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (2)(a) of this section.",
      "skos:definition": "Minister or authorised persons\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to the Minister; and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to the Minister (the recipient) a\nphotograph or other image from which the Department\ncan derive (such as by cropping) a photograph or other\nimage of the person’s face; and\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 11\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides.\n\n(2) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e); and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e) (the recipient) a photograph or\nother image from which the Department can derive\n(such as by cropping) a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face; and\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides.\n\n(3) For the purposes of the citizenship law, the person is taken to\nprovide the derived image to the recipient for the purposes of the\nrequirement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (2)(a) of this section.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "27f9507a1d1fcdb7f2432ba4c99953d27e95c5801253c3df8211fc76f672df7e"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-10b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10B Providing photographs and other images of faces to the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "Minister or authorised persons\n\n(1) This section applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to the Minister; and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to the Minister (the recipient) a\nphotograph or other image from which the Department\ncan derive (such as by cropping) a photograph or other\nimage of the person’s face; and\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\n\nSection 11\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides.\n\n(2) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e); and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e) (the recipient) a photograph or\nother image from which the Department can derive\n(such as by cropping) a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face; and\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides.\n\n(3) For the purposes of the citizenship law, the person is taken to\nprovide the derived image to the recipient for the purposes of the\nrequirement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (2)(a) of this section."
    },
