    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "10B(2) Providing photographs and other images of faces to the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-10b-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(2) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e); and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e) (the recipient) a photograph or\nother image from which the Department can derive\n(such as by cropping) a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face; and\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e); and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e) (the recipient) a photograph or\nother image from which the Department can derive\n(such as by cropping) a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face; and\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "85038743405c012d006f1aab3c74b655d17082685111641e869fcac4bef0d05f",
      "skos:note": "Provide a photograph or other image of the person's face to a specified recipient.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-10b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "10B(2) Providing photographs and other images of faces to the",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(2) This section also applies if:\n\n(a) the citizenship law requires a person to provide a photograph\nor other image of the person’s face to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e); and\n\n(b) for the purposes of that requirement:\n\n(i) the person provides to a person mentioned in\nparagraph 40(1)(d) or (e) (the recipient) a photograph or\nother image from which the Department can derive\n(such as by cropping) a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face; and\n\n(ii) the Department derives a photograph or other image of\nthe person’s face (the derived image) from the\nphotograph or other image that the person provides."
    },
