      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of the citizenship law, the person is taken to\nprovide the derived image to the recipient for the purposes of the\nrequirement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (2)(a) of this section.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For the purposes of the citizenship law, the person is taken to\nprovide the derived image to the recipient for the purposes of the\nrequirement mentioned in paragraph (1)(a) or (2)(a) of this section.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-10b"
