      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "External Territories\n\n(1) This Act extends to the external Territories.\nApplication outside Australia\n\n(2) This Act extends unless the contrary intention appears:\n\n(a) to acts, omissions, matters and things outside Australia; and\n\n(b) to all persons, irrespective of their nationality or citizenship.\nState and Territory laws\n\n(3) It is the intention of the Parliament that this Act apply to the\nexclusion of any provisions of a law of a State or Territory that",
      "skos:definition": "External Territories\n\n(1) This Act extends to the external Territories.\nApplication outside Australia\n\n(2) This Act extends unless the contrary intention appears:\n\n(a) to acts, omissions, matters and things outside Australia; and\n\n(b) to all persons, irrespective of their nationality or citizenship.\nState and Territory laws\n\n(3) It is the intention of the Parliament that this Act apply to the\nexclusion of any provisions of a law of a State or Territory that",
