      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "A person is an Australian citizen if the person is found abandoned\nin Australia as a child, unless and until the contrary is proved.",
      "skos:definition": "A person is an Australian citizen if the person is found abandoned\nin Australia as a child, unless and until the contrary is proved.",
