      "cml:premiseText": "(1) A person is an Australian citizen if:\n\n(a) any territory becomes a part of Australia; and\n\n(b) the person is included in a class of persons specified in a\ndetermination under this section.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person is an Australian citizen if..."
