    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-15-2-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15(2) Citizenship by incorporation of Territory",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-15-2-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.24",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that\nspecified classes of persons are Australian citizens from a specified\nday because of their connection with that territory.\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nAutomatic acquisition of Australian citizenship  Division 1\n\nSection 15\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nDay citizenship begins",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that\nspecified classes of persons are Australian citizens from a specified\nday because of their connection with that territory.\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nAutomatic acquisition of Australian citizenship  Division 1\n\nSection 15\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nDay citizenship begins",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-15-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-15-2-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-15-2-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9431ca5823a85aca2ecaead5b0f0f15f1b866bd1b56c6e2d7b6f15a79a2e0382",
      "skos:note": "Minister may determine classes of persons are Australian citizens from a specified day."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-15-2-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15(2) Citizenship by incorporation of Territory",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 24,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that\nspecified classes of persons are Australian citizens from a specified\nday because of their connection with that territory.\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nAutomatic acquisition of Australian citizenship  Division 1\n\nSection 15\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nDay citizenship begins"
    },
