      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "26 January 1949 and a parent of yours was an Australian",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-26"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "citizen on 26 January 1949: see subsection 16(3).\nYou must make an application to become an Australian citizen.\nThe Minister must approve or refuse you becoming an Australian\ncitizen.\nYou must be eligible to be an Australian citizen to be approved.\nThe Minister may be required to refuse your application on\ngrounds relating to:\n•\nnon-satisfaction of identity: see subsection 17(3); or\n•\nnational security: see subsections 17(4) to (4B); or\n•\ncessation of citizenship: see subsection 17(5).\nYou will be registered if the Minister approves you becoming an\nAustralian citizen.\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nAcquisition of Australian citizenship by application  Division 2\n\nSection 16\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nYou do not become an Australian citizen, even if the Minister\napproves you becoming an Australian citizen, unless a parent of\nyours was an Australian citizen at a particular time: see\nsection 19A.",
      "skos:definition": "citizen on 26 January 1949: see subsection 16(3).\nYou must make an application to become an Australian citizen.\nThe Minister must approve or refuse you becoming an Australian\ncitizen.\nYou must be eligible to be an Australian citizen to be approved.\nThe Minister may be required to refuse your application on\ngrounds relating to:\n•\nnon-satisfaction of identity: see subsection 17(3); or\n•\nnational security: see subsections 17(4) to (4B); or\n•\ncessation of citizenship: see subsection 17(5).\nYou will be registered if the Minister approves you becoming an\nAustralian citizen.\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nAcquisition of Australian citizenship by application  Division 2\n\nSection 16\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nYou do not become an Australian citizen, even if the Minister\napproves you becoming an Australian citizen, unless a parent of\nyours was an Australian citizen at a particular time: see\nsection 19A.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "403274f655fe72eccb82d47d1172993dca8a4f5884f1e85d483bb210b973e03e",
      "skos:note": "Must apply for Australian citizenship and meet eligibility criteria.",
      "dc:description": "Application, Eligibility"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-26",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26 January 1949 and a parent of yours was an Australian",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "citizen on 26 January 1949: see subsection 16(3).\nYou must make an application to become an Australian citizen.\nThe Minister must approve or refuse you becoming an Australian\ncitizen.\nYou must be eligible to be an Australian citizen to be approved.\nThe Minister may be required to refuse your application on\ngrounds relating to:\n•\nnon-satisfaction of identity: see subsection 17(3); or\n•\nnational security: see subsections 17(4) to (4B); or\n•\ncessation of citizenship: see subsection 17(5).\nYou will be registered if the Minister approves you becoming an\nAustralian citizen.\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nAcquisition of Australian citizenship by application  Division 2\n\nSection 16\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nYou do not become an Australian citizen, even if the Minister\napproves you becoming an Australian citizen, unless a parent of\nyours was an Australian citizen at a particular time: see\nsection 19A."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26-norm",
