      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(4B) A person is covered by this subsection if:\n\n(a) at the time the person made the application under section 16,\nthe person:\n\n(i) is not a national of any country; and\n\n(ii) is not a citizen of any country; and\n\n(b) at the time of the person’s birth, the person had a parent who\nwas an Australian citizen.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(4B) A person is covered by this subsection if:\n\n(a) at the time the person made the application under section 16,\nthe person:\n\n(i) is not a national of any country; and\n\n(ii) is not a citizen of any country; and\n\n(b) at the time of the person’s birth, the person had a parent who\nwas an Australian citizen."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-17-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "17(5) Minister’s decision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-17-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
