      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the person has at any time ceased to be an Australian citizen, the\nMinister must not approve the person becoming an Australian\ncitizen during the period of 12 months starting on the day on which\nthe person ceased, or last ceased, to be an Australian citizen.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If the person has at any time ceased to be an Australian citizen, the\nMinister must not approve the person becoming an Australian\ncitizen during the period of 12 months starting on the day on which\nthe person ceased, or last ceased, to be an Australian citizen.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-17"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
