          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-17-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-17-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cda8daeaddb92239e5f26207bdc4e02bb837f55df949c649e51204d40e87723e",
      "skos:note": "Minister cannot approve person becoming Australian citizen during specified period after ceasing citizenship."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-17-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17(5) Minister’s decision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the person has at any time ceased to be an Australian citizen, the\nMinister must not approve the person becoming an Australian\ncitizen during the period of 12 months starting on the day on which\nthe person ceased, or last ceased, to be an Australian citizen."
    },
