    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-19d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19D(6) Minister’s decision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-19d-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the person is covered by subsection (7), the Minister must not\napprove the person becoming an Australian citizen if the person:\n\n(a) if subparagraph (7)(b)(i) applies to the person:\n\n(i) has been convicted of a national security offence; or\n\n(ii) subject to subsection (7A), has been convicted of an\noffence against an Australian law or a foreign law, for\nwhich the person has been sentenced to a period of\nimprisonment of at least 5 years; or",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the person is covered by subsection (7), the Minister must not\napprove the person becoming an Australian citizen if the person:\n\n(a) if subparagraph (7)(b)(i) applies to the person:\n\n(i) has been convicted of a national security offence; or\n\n(ii) subject to subsection (7A), has been convicted of an\noffence against an Australian law or a foreign law, for\nwhich the person has been sentenced to a period of\nimprisonment of at least 5 years; or",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-19d"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-19d-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-19d-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-19d-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-19d-ss-6-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-19d-ss-6-logic-cogai-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-19d-ss-6-logic-shacl-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b674fcadc570041f82b2b2685b443639bc684bfc558f9b20920ec0fbbbf6713a",
      "skos:note": "Minister must not approve person becoming Australian citizen under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-19d-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19D(6) Minister’s decision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the person is covered by subsection (7), the Minister must not\napprove the person becoming an Australian citizen if the person:\n\n(a) if subparagraph (7)(b)(i) applies to the person:\n\n(i) has been convicted of a national security offence; or\n\n(ii) subject to subsection (7A), has been convicted of an\noffence against an Australian law or a foreign law, for\nwhich the person has been sentenced to a period of\nimprisonment of at least 5 years; or"
    },
