      "skos:note": "Minister must approve or refuse application for Australian citizenship."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-24-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "24(1) Minister’s decision",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 55,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a person makes an application under section 21, the Minister\nmust, by writing, approve or refuse to approve the person\nbecoming an Australian citizen.\nNote:\nThe Minister may cancel an approval: see section 25."
    },
