      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If a determination is in force in relation to a person, the person\nmust not make a pledge of commitment before the end of the\nperiod specified in the determination. A pledge of commitment\nmade by the person before that time is of no effect.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If a determination is in force in relation to a person, the person\nmust not make a pledge of commitment before the end of the\nperiod specified in the determination. A pledge of commitment\nmade by the person before that time is of no effect.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26-3-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26-3-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3b981ef690d32eb96597a2c28f672a6f8b335e9e895afe21958cd7b7511b7cba",
      "skos:note": "Cannot make pledge of commitment before end of specified period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-26-3-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "26(6) Pledge of commitment must be made",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If a determination is in force in relation to a person, the person\nmust not make a pledge of commitment before the end of the\nperiod specified in the determination. A pledge of commitment\nmade by the person before that time is of no effect."
    },
