      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person required to make a pledge of commitment becomes an\nAustralian citizen under this Subdivision on the day on which the\nperson makes the pledge.\nPersons not required to make pledge of commitment",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person required to make a pledge of commitment becomes an\nAustralian citizen under this Subdivision on the day on which the\nperson makes the pledge.\nPersons not required to make pledge of commitment",
      "values:partOf": {
