      "values:originalText": "(2) If, at the cessation time, another responsible parent of the child is\nan Australian citizen, subsection (1) does not apply to the child:\n\n(a) while there is a responsible parent who is an Australian\ncitizen; and\n\n(b) if there ceases to be such a responsible parent because of the\ndeath of a responsible parent—at any time after that death.\nException—statelessness"
    },
