      "values:originalText": "(2) However, the court must not make an order under subsection (1) in\nrelation to the person if the court is satisfied that the person would,\nif the court were to make the order, become a person who is not a\nnational or citizen of any country.\nSerious offence",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, the court must not make an order under subsection (1) in\nrelation to the person if the court is satisfied that the person would,\nif the court were to make the order, become a person who is not a\nnational or citizen of any country.\nSerious offence",
