      "skos:note": "Minister may cancel a notice given to a person under this section."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-37-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "37(6) Evidence of Australian citizenship",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 82,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The Minister may, by writing, cancel a notice given to a person\nunder this section.\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nEvidence of Australian citizenship  Division 4\n\nSection 38\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
