      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) the Minister makes a decision under section 34 or 34A to\nrevoke a person’s Australian citizenship; and\n\n(b) at the time of the revocation, there is in force a notice under\nsection 37 in relation to the person; and\n\n(c) the notice was given to the person in a physical form;\nthe Minister may request the person to surrender the notice to the\nMinister.",
