      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.83",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A request given to a person under subsection (1) or (2) must:\n\n(a) be made in writing; and\n\n(b) specify the day on or before which the person must surrender\nthe notice (which must be a day at least 28 days after the day\non which the Minister makes the request); and\n\n(c) specify how the person is to surrender the notice to the\nMinister; and\n\n(d) contain a statement to the effect that a failure to comply with\nthe request is an offence.\nOffence",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A request given to a person under subsection (1) or (2) must:\n\n(a) be made in writing; and\n\n(b) specify the day on or before which the person must surrender\nthe notice (which must be a day at least 28 days after the day\non which the Minister makes the request); and\n\n(c) specify how the person is to surrender the notice to the\nMinister; and\n\n(d) contain a statement to the effect that a failure to comply with\nthe request is an offence.\nOffence",
