    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-40",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40 Request for personal identifiers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-40"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of the Minister being satisfied of the identity of:\n\n(a) a person in relation to an application under this Part; or\n\n(b) a person who has sought to sit a test approved in a\ndetermination under section 23A;\nthe following persons may request the person, in writing, to\nprovide one or more specified personal identifiers:\n\n(c) the Minister;\n\n(d) a person authorised under subsection (3);\n\n(e) a person who is included in a class of persons authorised\nunder subsection (4).\nForm of request\n\n(2) A request must inform the person of the matters prescribed by the\nregulations.\nAuthorisations\n\n(3) The Minister may, by writing, authorise a person for the purposes\nof paragraph (1)(d).\n\n(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, authorise a class of\npersons for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of the Minister being satisfied of the identity of:\n\n(a) a person in relation to an application under this Part; or\n\n(b) a person who has sought to sit a test approved in a\ndetermination under section 23A;\nthe following persons may request the person, in writing, to\nprovide one or more specified personal identifiers:\n\n(c) the Minister;\n\n(d) a person authorised under subsection (3);\n\n(e) a person who is included in a class of persons authorised\nunder subsection (4).\nForm of request\n\n(2) A request must inform the person of the matters prescribed by the\nregulations.\nAuthorisations\n\n(3) The Minister may, by writing, authorise a person for the purposes\nof paragraph (1)(d).\n\n(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, authorise a class of\npersons for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-40-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-40-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-40-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-40-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "01f54e9b3faf12aaa9347e042240b887904cab53588d078e56d82f1176987a58"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-40",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "40 Request for personal identifiers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 85,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of the Minister being satisfied of the identity of:\n\n(a) a person in relation to an application under this Part; or\n\n(b) a person who has sought to sit a test approved in a\ndetermination under section 23A;\nthe following persons may request the person, in writing, to\nprovide one or more specified personal identifiers:\n\n(c) the Minister;\n\n(d) a person authorised under subsection (3);\n\n(e) a person who is included in a class of persons authorised\nunder subsection (4).\nForm of request\n\n(2) A request must inform the person of the matters prescribed by the\nregulations.\nAuthorisations\n\n(3) The Minister may, by writing, authorise a person for the purposes\nof paragraph (1)(d).\n\n(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, authorise a class of\npersons for the purposes of paragraph (1)(e)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-40-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "40(1) Request for personal identifiers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-40-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.85",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of the Minister being satisfied of the identity of:\n\n(a) a person in relation to an application under this Part; or\n\n(b) a person who has sought to sit a test approved in a\ndetermination under section 23A;\nthe following persons may request the person, in writing, to\nprovide one or more specified personal identifiers:\n\n(c) the Minister;\n\n(d) a person authorised under subsection (3);\n\n(e) a person who is included in a class of persons authorised\nunder subsection (4).\nForm of request",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of the Minister being satisfied of the identity of:\n\n(a) a person in relation to an application under this Part; or\n\n(b) a person who has sought to sit a test approved in a\ndetermination under section 23A;\nthe following persons may request the person, in writing, to\nprovide one or more specified personal identifiers:\n\n(c) the Minister;\n\n(d) a person authorised under subsection (3);\n\n(e) a person who is included in a class of persons authorised\nunder subsection (4).\nForm of request",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-40"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
