      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 85,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of the Minister being satisfied of the identity of:\n\n(a) a person in relation to an application under this Part; or\n\n(b) a person who has sought to sit a test approved in a\ndetermination under section 23A;\nthe following persons may request the person, in writing, to\nprovide one or more specified personal identifiers:\n\n(c) the Minister;\n\n(d) a person authorised under subsection (3);\n\n(e) a person who is included in a class of persons authorised\nunder subsection (4).\nForm of request"
    },
