      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.86",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister must specify in an authorisation under subsection (3),\nas the purpose or purposes for which access is authorised, one or\nmore of the following purposes:\n\n(a) either or both of the purposes set out in paragraph 10(2)(c);\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nPersonal identifiers  Division 5\n\nSection 43\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) disclosing identifying information in accordance with this\nDivision;\n\n(c) administering or managing the storage of identifying\ninformation;\n\n(d) making identifying information available to the person to\nwhom it relates;\n\n(e) modifying identifying information to enable it to be matched\nwith other identifying information;\n\n(f) modifying identifying information in order to correct errors\nor ensure compliance with appropriate standards;\n\n(g) the purposes of this Act or the regulations or of the Migration\nAct 1958 or the regulations made under that Act;\n\n(h) complying with Australian laws.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Minister must specify in an authorisation under subsection (3),\nas the purpose or purposes for which access is authorised, one or\nmore of the following purposes:\n\n(a) either or both of the purposes set out in paragraph 10(2)(c);\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nPersonal identifiers  Division 5\n\nSection 43\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) disclosing identifying information in accordance with this\nDivision;\n\n(c) administering or managing the storage of identifying\ninformation;\n\n(d) making identifying information available to the person to\nwhom it relates;\n\n(e) modifying identifying information to enable it to be matched\nwith other identifying information;\n\n(f) modifying identifying information in order to correct errors\nor ensure compliance with appropriate standards;\n\n(g) the purposes of this Act or the regulations or of the Migration\nAct 1958 or the regulations made under that Act;\n\n(h) complying with Australian laws.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-42"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-42-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-42-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dd02aaf4a406758f119e461bd4289b780d32f0f90384b0c62ddef18851d97bb5",
      "skos:note": "The Minister must specify purposes for which access is authorised."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-42-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42(4) Accessing identifying information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 86,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister must specify in an authorisation under subsection (3),\nas the purpose or purposes for which access is authorised, one or\nmore of the following purposes:\n\n(a) either or both of the purposes set out in paragraph 10(2)(c);\n\n\nAustralian citizenship  Part 2\nPersonal identifiers  Division 5\n\nSection 43\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) disclosing identifying information in accordance with this\nDivision;\n\n(c) administering or managing the storage of identifying\ninformation;\n\n(d) making identifying information available to the person to\nwhom it relates;\n\n(e) modifying identifying information to enable it to be matched\nwith other identifying information;\n\n(f) modifying identifying information in order to correct errors\nor ensure compliance with appropriate standards;\n\n(g) the purposes of this Act or the regulations or of the Migration\nAct 1958 or the regulations made under that Act;\n\n(h) complying with Australian laws."
    },
