      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of this section, a database is a discrete body of\ninformation stored by electronic means, containing:\n\n(a) indexes of persons who have provided personal identifiers in\naccordance with a request under this Division; and\n\n(b) their identifying information."
    },
