    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45B(3) Seizure of bogus documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-45b-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.92",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The notice must:\n\n(a) identify the document; and\n\n(b) state that the document has been seized; and\n\n(c) specify the reason for the seizure; and\n\n(d) state that the document will be condemned as forfeited unless\nthe person institutes proceedings against the Commonwealth\nbefore the end of the period specified in the notice:\n\n(i) to recover the document; or\n\n(ii) for a declaration that the document is not forfeited.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The notice must:\n\n(a) identify the document; and\n\n(b) state that the document has been seized; and\n\n(c) specify the reason for the seizure; and\n\n(d) state that the document will be condemned as forfeited unless\nthe person institutes proceedings against the Commonwealth\nbefore the end of the period specified in the notice:\n\n(i) to recover the document; or\n\n(ii) for a declaration that the document is not forfeited.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ef64d65f75deeac2cf35c53f2151f62e08c625139bce82df132f2e107ccead97",
      "skos:note": "Notice must specify reason for seizure and allow person to institute proceedings.",
      "dc:description": "Reason for seizure, notice period"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-45b-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45B(3) Seizure of bogus documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 92,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The notice must:\n\n(a) identify the document; and\n\n(b) state that the document has been seized; and\n\n(c) specify the reason for the seizure; and\n\n(d) state that the document will be condemned as forfeited unless\nthe person institutes proceedings against the Commonwealth\nbefore the end of the period specified in the notice:\n\n(i) to recover the document; or\n\n(ii) for a declaration that the document is not forfeited."
    },
