    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "45B(4) Seizure of bogus documents",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-45b-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.92",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(d), the period must:\n\n\nOther matters  Part 3\nBogus documents  Division 1\n\nSection 45C\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) start on the date of the notice; and\n\n(b) end 90 days after that date.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(d), the period must:\n\n\nOther matters  Part 3\nBogus documents  Division 1\n\nSection 45C\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) start on the date of the notice; and\n\n(b) end 90 days after that date.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6d70e0d3ddd1d343d04e42e75ea5550dc31683e40db30f87bb973906feac5b6c",
      "skos:note": "The period for seizure of bogus documents must start on the date of notice and end 90 days after that."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-45b-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "45B(4) Seizure of bogus documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 92,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (3)(d), the period must:\n\n\nOther matters  Part 3\nBogus documents  Division 1\n\nSection 45C\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) start on the date of the notice; and\n\n(b) end 90 days after that date."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-45b-ss-4-norm",
