    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-47",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "47 Notification of decisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-47"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Minister makes a decision under this Act in relation to a\nperson, the Minister must give the person notice of the decision.\nChild\n\n(2) If the person is a child, the Minister satisfies the requirement in\nsubsection (1) if the Minister gives a parent of the child notice of\nthe decision.\nReasons for adverse decision\n\n(3) If the decision is an adverse decision, the notice must include the\nreasons for the decision.\n\n\nOther matters  Part 3\nOther  Division 2\n\nSection 48\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nForm of notice\n\n(4) The Minister must give the notice in the manner prescribed by the\nregulations (which includes electronic form).\nProcedural defect does not affect validity of decision\n\n(5) A failure to comply with subsection (3) or (4) does not affect the\nvalidity of the decision.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If the Minister makes a decision under this Act in relation to a\nperson, the Minister must give the person notice of the decision.\nChild\n\n(2) If the person is a child, the Minister satisfies the requirement in\nsubsection (1) if the Minister gives a parent of the child notice of\nthe decision.\nReasons for adverse decision\n\n(3) If the decision is an adverse decision, the notice must include the\nreasons for the decision.\n\n\nOther matters  Part 3\nOther  Division 2\n\nSection 48\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nForm of notice\n\n(4) The Minister must give the notice in the manner prescribed by the\nregulations (which includes electronic form).\nProcedural defect does not affect validity of decision\n\n(5) A failure to comply with subsection (3) or (4) does not affect the\nvalidity of the decision.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-47-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-47-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-47-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-47-ss-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-47-ss-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1be9b16c1b4d79ac252578af3ab3b84be5af51126a4a72bf3b8bac26fbfe6f4d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-47",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "47 Notification of decisions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If the Minister makes a decision under this Act in relation to a\nperson, the Minister must give the person notice of the decision.\nChild\n\n(2) If the person is a child, the Minister satisfies the requirement in\nsubsection (1) if the Minister gives a parent of the child notice of\nthe decision.\nReasons for adverse decision\n\n(3) If the decision is an adverse decision, the notice must include the\nreasons for the decision.\n\n\nOther matters  Part 3\nOther  Division 2\n\nSection 48\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nForm of notice\n\n(4) The Minister must give the notice in the manner prescribed by the\nregulations (which includes electronic form).\nProcedural defect does not affect validity of decision\n\n(5) A failure to comply with subsection (3) or (4) does not affect the\nvalidity of the decision."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-47-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "47(1) Notification of decisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
