    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-48",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "48 Computerised decision-making",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-48"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.97",
      "values:originalText": "Computer-based decisions\n\n(1) The Minister may, by writing, arrange for the use, under the\nMinister’s control, of computer programs for any purposes for\nwhich the Minister may, or must, under this Act or the regulations:\n\n(a) make a decision; or\n\n(b) exercise any power or comply with any obligation; or\n\n(c) do anything else related to making a decision or exercising a\npower or complying with an obligation.\n\n(2) The Minister is taken to have:\n\n(a) made a decision; or\n\n(b) exercised a power or complied with an obligation; or\n\n(c) done something else related to the making of a decision or\nthe exercise of a power or the compliance with an obligation;\nthat was made, exercised, complied with or done by the operation\nof a computer program under such an arrangement.\nMinister may substitute his or her own decision\n\n(3) The Minister may substitute a decision (the substituted decision)\nfor a decision (the initial decision) made by the operation of a\ncomputer program under such an arrangement if:\n\n(a) a notice under section 49 relates to the computer program and\nto the initial decision; and",
      "skos:definition": "Computer-based decisions\n\n(1) The Minister may, by writing, arrange for the use, under the\nMinister’s control, of computer programs for any purposes for\nwhich the Minister may, or must, under this Act or the regulations:\n\n(a) make a decision; or\n\n(b) exercise any power or comply with any obligation; or\n\n(c) do anything else related to making a decision or exercising a\npower or complying with an obligation.\n\n(2) The Minister is taken to have:\n\n(a) made a decision; or\n\n(b) exercised a power or complied with an obligation; or\n\n(c) done something else related to the making of a decision or\nthe exercise of a power or the compliance with an obligation;\nthat was made, exercised, complied with or done by the operation\nof a computer program under such an arrangement.\nMinister may substitute his or her own decision\n\n(3) The Minister may substitute a decision (the substituted decision)\nfor a decision (the initial decision) made by the operation of a\ncomputer program under such an arrangement if:\n\n(a) a notice under section 49 relates to the computer program and\nto the initial decision; and",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-48-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-48-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-48-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "25f05a8dfcff731e05f6daca64c526ad18ac410e47373b35fa0e0d4026959c66"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-48",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "48 Computerised decision-making",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 97,
      "values:originalText": "Computer-based decisions\n\n(1) The Minister may, by writing, arrange for the use, under the\nMinister’s control, of computer programs for any purposes for\nwhich the Minister may, or must, under this Act or the regulations:\n\n(a) make a decision; or\n\n(b) exercise any power or comply with any obligation; or\n\n(c) do anything else related to making a decision or exercising a\npower or complying with an obligation.\n\n(2) The Minister is taken to have:\n\n(a) made a decision; or\n\n(b) exercised a power or complied with an obligation; or\n\n(c) done something else related to the making of a decision or\nthe exercise of a power or the compliance with an obligation;\nthat was made, exercised, complied with or done by the operation\nof a computer program under such an arrangement.\nMinister may substitute his or her own decision\n\n(3) The Minister may substitute a decision (the substituted decision)\nfor a decision (the initial decision) made by the operation of a\ncomputer program under such an arrangement if:\n\n(a) a notice under section 49 relates to the computer program and\nto the initial decision; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-48-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "48(1) Computerised decision-making",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-48-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.97",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Minister may, by writing, arrange for the use, under the\nMinister’s control, of computer programs for any purposes for\nwhich the Minister may, or must, under this Act or the regulations:\n\n(a) make a decision; or\n\n(b) exercise any power or comply with any obligation; or\n\n(c) do anything else related to making a decision or exercising a\npower or complying with an obligation.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Minister may, by writing, arrange for the use, under the\nMinister’s control, of computer programs for any purposes for\nwhich the Minister may, or must, under this Act or the regulations:\n\n(a) make a decision; or\n\n(b) exercise any power or comply with any obligation; or\n\n(c) do anything else related to making a decision or exercising a\npower or complying with an obligation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-48"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
