    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-48-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "48(3) Computerised decision-making",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-48-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.97",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may substitute a decision (the substituted decision)\nfor a decision (the initial decision) made by the operation of a\ncomputer program under such an arrangement if:\n\n(a) a notice under section 49 relates to the computer program and\nto the initial decision; and",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may substitute a decision (the substituted decision)\nfor a decision (the initial decision) made by the operation of a\ncomputer program under such an arrangement if:\n\n(a) a notice under section 49 relates to the computer program and\nto the initial decision; and",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-48"
      },
