      "skos:note": "Allowance for substitution of decision made by computer program"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-48-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "48(3) Computerised decision-making",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 97,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may substitute a decision (the substituted decision)\nfor a decision (the initial decision) made by the operation of a\ncomputer program under such an arrangement if:\n\n(a) a notice under section 49 relates to the computer program and\nto the initial decision; and"
    },
