      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-52-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits review of decision for refusing citizenship application by applicant over 18.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) However, if:\n\n(a) the Minister makes a decision under section 24 to refuse to\napprove a person becoming an Australian citizen; and\n\n(b) the Minister’s reasons for the decision did not refer to the\neligibility ground in subsection 21(8) (about statelessness);\na person (the applicant) cannot apply for review of that decision\nunless the applicant is a permanent resident.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(2) However, if:\n\n(a) the Minister makes a decision under section 24 to refuse to\napprove a person becoming an Australian citizen; and\n\n(b) the Minister’s reasons for the decision did not refer to the\neligibility ground in subsection 21(8) (about statelessness);\na person (the applicant) cannot apply for review of that decision\nunless the applicant is a permanent resident."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-52-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "52(3) Review of decisions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-act-2007#sec-52-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
