      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-act-2007.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "The Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters:\n\n(a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed; or\n\n(b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or\ngiving effect to this Act.\n\nPledge of commitment as a citizen of the Commonwealth of Australia  Schedule 1\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "The Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters:\n\n(a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed; or\n\n(b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or\ngiving effect to this Act.\n\nPledge of commitment as a citizen of the Commonwealth of Australia  Schedule 1\n\nAustralian Citizenship Act 2007\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:asserts": [
